{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"KnightOfCydonia","id":"436232470242000916","is_bot":0,"username":"knightofcydonia21"},"author_id":"436232470242000916","channel_id":"736455866622017587","content":"\"Right here your honor, the pages i had been writing in were torn out methodically as well as rat whiskers i have found nearby... considering the accused is one who practices druidic magics it is likely they could have wildshaped into my room.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T18:48:31.972000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738105698956869684","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"736455866622017587","content":"\"Likely but hardly hard proof. But I will take the circumstances under consideration unless the defense changes my mind. And the feathers?\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T18:49:50.125000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738106026754179153","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"KnightOfCydonia","id":"436232470242000916","is_bot":0,"username":"knightofcydonia21"},"author_id":"436232470242000916","channel_id":"736455866622017587","content":"\"Yes your honor, this feather is rahviolis the victim, i plucked from them myself and this feather was found in the deceased's bed however i have confirmation from one of the hunters on ship that this is in facts goans feather found in the deceased's bed... this feather was found when the body was found...\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T18:52:06.328000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738106598031097976","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"736455866622017587","content":"\"I see. If that proves to be true it might well be damning. What does the defense have to say?\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T18:52:54.300000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738106799240118355","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"736455866622017587","content":"\"Capitan all of this evidence works if we assume the accused is at fault. The rat whiskers could easily belong to Skitter, he has been known to make mischief and tunnels connecting passengers rooms. As for the feather, Rahvioli was found in his room, Goanhawe was his roommate. If anyone was around someone long enough it wouldn't be difficult to find a a hair or in this case feather on them. They have been living together for almost three months. The testimony from Kiln isn't related to this case either. A secret room, secret to the passengers, is not related to the murder of Rahvioli. It is a separate matter.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T18:57:47.890000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-29T18:57:53.860000Z","id":"738108030645960815","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"736455866622017587","content":"\"We both know that Kiln's letter contained more than what was said about the door in the surgery. Are you sure that is where the defense stands on this matter?\" Amaya looks concerned.","created_at":"2020-07-29T18:59:22.124000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-29T19:00:12.110000Z","id":"738108425891741826","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"736455866622017587","content":"\"I haven't spoken to him since a day ago, we were on the same page then.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T19:00:23.832000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738108684713984001","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"736455866622017587","content":"\"I am tasked to prove his innocence.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T19:01:09.480000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738108876175704204","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"736455866622017587","content":"\"Sir Castor, in lieu of calling a witness, do you wish to have the letter read? or would you prefer to call some one now?\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T19:02:03.239000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738109101657030697","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"KnightOfCydonia","id":"436232470242000916","is_bot":0,"username":"knightofcydonia21"},"author_id":"436232470242000916","channel_id":"736455866622017587","content":"\"Yes i would like the letter read if you wouldnt mind,\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T19:02:29.228000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738109210663059526","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"736455866622017587","content":"\"Archivist, I believe that I have set up camp on tha front porch of the Golden Dawn's hideout on the ship. I also have reason ta believe that Brother Ebuc is a traitor, he conspires wit Goan --doin his biddin an such. He even admitted to me that he owes Goan his life. The one they call Web is suspect as well, during my autopsy o Brother Rah, tha voice o Skitter spoke from behind them. \n\nI'm afraid Archivist, fer my well bein. I'll likely be following the same path as Brother Rah. Which brings me ta their method of murder, some how they are able to draw tha very life force from their victims. It seems to be an incredibly powerful magik, and makes sense that Rah had no injuries on his body.\n\nBest of luck ta all my Siblings in tha Mason's. \n\nKiln Singebeard, Afflicted of Osiris. \"","created_at":"2020-07-29T19:02:45.269000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738109277943758949","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"736455866622017587","content":"\"How does the defense account for this?\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T19:03:58.105000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738109583440216106","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"736455866622017587","content":"\"Fear is a real thing, and I don't dismiss Kilns concern, however fear can cloud judgment. Even if the accused is apart of the Golden Dawn, this doesn't relate to the murder. Goanhawe is a trial here, not the Golden Dawn. \"","created_at":"2020-07-29T19:06:51.323000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738110309969035324","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"KnightOfCydonia","id":"436232470242000916","is_bot":0,"username":"knightofcydonia21"},"author_id":"436232470242000916","channel_id":"736455866622017587","content":"\"Excuse me if i may your honor, i specifically levied the charge of collusion in the murder of Rahvioli against the accused, seeing as the cause of death was such higher powered magics, Goan is on trial here because of his ties to the golden dawn, and since I cant charge an entire organization for a crime this has to suffice\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T19:08:31.436000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738110729873522858","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
