{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"736455866622017587","content":"Amaya is not the least bit startled by the Yeti's appearance. \"Collusion is a different matter entirely. Are you suggesting a conspiracy? If so, we can hardly pass judgement and execution on a single part of that party.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T19:11:32.036000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-29T19:12:31.647000Z","id":"738111487364825143","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"KnightOfCydonia","id":"436232470242000916","is_bot":0,"username":"knightofcydonia21"},"author_id":"436232470242000916","channel_id":"736455866622017587","content":"\"I fully am suggesting a conspiracy is at foot here and I know that execution is impossible for that, I am hoping under the threat of law Goan will confess to us all he knows and has done regarding the golden dawn, and before you say anything about yesterdays court fiasco I would like you to be aware that one of my allies casted detect magic and discovered transmutation magic on the \"Goan\" that originally spoke who then ran off and casted some spell before appearing to reconsider his actions then attempt tofully run off again\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T19:14:21.015000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-29T19:14:33.345000Z","id":"738112196113989675","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
