{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"KnightOfCydonia","id":"436232470242000916","is_bot":0,"username":"knightofcydonia21"},"author_id":"436232470242000916","channel_id":"736455866622017587","content":"\"I am contending that the Golden dawn has been forcing passengers aboard this ship into their service under threats of violence... just look at my beloveds hand... burned right where the golden dawn tattoo was... take into account the burning of her bed which you yourself brought to my attention and accused Goanhawe of yourself... does that seem like something that would happen to a *Willing* member? or rather punishment for not wanting to obey their bidding?\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T19:19:37.612000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738113524018184312","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
