{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"736455866622017587","content":"\"Understood. The day before Rahvioli's body was discovered, the four of us bunking in <#636020443219886091> were talking. The discussion started after Copper  had found a scroll while outside the sub. Ebuc and I happened to be in the room when Goanhawe returned and began telling us about the scroll. Rah was passing by and so Goanhawe called him in to let him know about it as well. As I'm sure you are aware, there was much discussion about what was to be done with it, as it was a powerful demonic contract. We began sharing our opinions on what should be done with it, and Ebuc and Rah began to argue. It was heated for a while, but things eventually calmed down and Rah and Ebuc seemed not to hold it against one another. At that time, both Rah and I left the room for other locations on the sub.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T19:27:55.180000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738115610969374820","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"736455866622017587","content":"\"The next morning, Amara and Castor entered the room looking to talk to Rahvioli. I went to wake him up but discovered he was dead.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T19:28:26.626000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738115742863589556","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
