{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"KnightOfCydonia","id":"436232470242000916","is_bot":0,"username":"knightofcydonia21"},"author_id":"436232470242000916","channel_id":"736455866622017587","content":"\"Ok so... there is a massive time jump in your account, from the time you left to you waking up in the morning... that leaves quite a lot of time for anything to happen... this account doesnt seem to help Goanhawe nor demonize him... there is fully nothing to note with this account, other than the fact they are focusing on a contract rather than the murder or anything about the golden dawn\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T19:31:38.637000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-29T19:31:52.563000Z","id":"738116548215963659","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
