{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"736455866622017587","content":"\"Is this a trial about Goanhawe or about the conspiracy? It appears that both parties seem confused as to who or what is actually on trial here. Castor, make your choice and stick to it.\" The captian seems perturbed.","created_at":"2020-07-29T19:33:57.536000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-29T19:34:29.344000Z","id":"738117130800594975","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"KnightOfCydonia","id":"436232470242000916","is_bot":0,"username":"knightofcydonia21"},"author_id":"436232470242000916","channel_id":"736455866622017587","content":"\"I am sticking to it your honor but what about the witnesses account has anything to do with the golden dawn? Tell me that\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T19:34:33.431000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738117281355399279","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"736455866622017587","content":"\"I woke up from a nap in my room, and saw Rah sleeping, or so i thought. I do not recall who, but I remember someone from another room entering ours to talk with Goanhawe. They did so, and I recall them checking Rah's body to see if they could wake him up. They did not seem concerned or raise any alarm, so I believe Rah to have been alive and sleeping later that night.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T19:35:14.656000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738117454265581638","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
